      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. it sounds like they view these changes as more than just a difference of opinion. can you go deeper into the specific language they use to describe these modern shifts? like, how do they characterize the impact of these changes on the soul or the fabric of society? i want to capture the weight and the gravity of their perspective.",
